<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="fr">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>On Running Cloudtilt — Suisse</title>
<style>
  :root {
    --encre: #10283B;
    --surligneur: #F3D33B;
    --papier: #F5F6F2;
    --gris: #56636D;
  }
  * { box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0; padding: 0; }
  body {
    font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, "Segoe UI", Roboto, sans-serif;
    background: var(--papier);
    color: var(--encre);
    line-height: 1.5;
    padding-bottom: 90px;
  }
  h1, h2 {
    font-family: Charter, Georgia, serif;
  }
  header {
    padding: 32px 20px 24px;
    text-align: center;
  }
  header .tag {
    display: inline-block;
    background: var(--surligneur);
    color: var(--encre);
    font-weight: 700;
    font-size: 13px;
    padding: 4px 10px;
    border-radius: 4px;
    margin-bottom: 14px;
  }
  header h1 {
    font-size: 30px;
    line-height: 1.15;
    margin-bottom: 10px;
  }
  header p {
    color: var(--gris);
    font-size: 16px;
    max-width: 480px;
    margin: 0 auto;
  }
  .grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    gap: 16px;
    padding: 8px 20px 24px;
    max-width: 480px;
    margin: 0 auto;
  }
  @media (min-width: 640px) {
    .grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; max-width: 720px; }
  }
  .card {
    background: white;
    border-radius: 14px;
    overflow: hidden;
    box-shadow: 0 1px 3px rgba(16,40,59,0.08);
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
  }
  .swatch {
    height: 160px;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    font-family: Charter, Georgia, serif;
    font-size: 18px;
    font-weight: 600;
    color: white;
    text-shadow: 0 1px 3px rgba(0,0,0,0.25);
  }
  .swatch.noir { background: #1a1a1a; }
  .swatch.blanc { background: #d8d8d2; color: var(--encre); text-shadow: none; }
  .swatch.creme { background: #e9dfc8; color: var(--encre); text-shadow: none; }
  .swatch.bleu { background: #1e4d7b; }
  .card-body {
    padding: 16px 18px 18px;
  }
  .card-body h3 {
    font-size: 15px;
    color: var(--gris);
    font-weight: 500;
    margin-bottom: 2px;
  }
  .card-body .price {
    font-family: Charter, Georgia, serif;
    font-size: 22px;
    font-weight: 700;
    margin-bottom: 12px;
  }
  .btn {
    display: block;
    width: 100%;
    text-align: center;
    background: var(--encre);
    color: white;
    text-decoration: none;
    padding: 12px;
    border-radius: 8px;
    font-weight: 600;
    font-size: 15px;
  }
  .btn:active { opacity: 0.85; }
  .info {
    max-width: 480px;
    margin: 8px auto 0;
    padding: 16px 20px;
    color: var(--gris);
    font-size: 14px;
    text-align: center;
  }
  footer {
    text-align: center;
    color: var(--gris);
    font-size: 12px;
    padding: 30px 20px 10px;
  }
</style>
</head>
<body>

<header>
  <span class="tag">On Running Cloudtilt</span>
  <h1>La Cloudtilt, livrée chez vous en Suisse</h1>
  <p>Achetée en France, livrée en Suisse. 4 coloris disponibles, 190 CHF la paire.</p>
</header>

<div class="grid">

  <div class="card">
    <div class="swatch noir">Noir</div>
    <div class="card-body">
      <h3>On Running Cloudtilt</h3>
      <div class="price">190 CHF</div>
      <a class="btn" href="mailto:noatestutgstyr@icloud.com?subject=Commande%20Cloudtilt%20Noir&body=Bonjour%2C%20je%20souhaite%20commander%20une%20paire%20On%20Running%20Cloudtilt%20Noir%20(190%20CHF).%20Ma%20pointure%3A%20">Commander</a>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="card">
    <div class="swatch blanc">Blanc</div>
    <div class="card-body">
      <h3>On Running Cloudtilt</h3>
      <div class="price">190 CHF</div>
      <a class="btn" href="mailto:noatestutgstyr@icloud.com?subject=Commande%20Cloudtilt%20Blanc&body=Bonjour%2C%20je%20souhaite%20commander%20une%20paire%20On%20Running%20Cloudtilt%20Blanc%20(190%20CHF).%20Ma%20pointure%3A%20">Commander</a>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="card">
    <div class="swatch creme">Crème</div>
    <div class="card-body">
      <h3>On Running Cloudtilt</h3>
      <div class="price">190 CHF</div>
      <a class="btn" href="mailto:noatestutgstyr@icloud.com?subject=Commande%20Cloudtilt%20Cr%C3%A8me&body=Bonjour%2C%20je%20souhaite%20commander%20une%20paire%20On%20Running%20Cloudtilt%20Cr%C3%A8me%20(190%20CHF).%20Ma%20pointure%3A%20">Commander</a>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="card">
    <div class="swatch bleu">Bleu</div>
    <div class="card-body">
      <h3>On Running Cloudtilt</h3>
      <div class="price">190 CHF</div>
      <a class="btn" href="mailto:noatestutgstyr@icloud.com?subject=Commande%20Cloudtilt%20Bleu&body=Bonjour%2C%20je%20souhaite%20commander%20une%20paire%20On%20Running%20Cloudtilt%20Bleu%20(190%20CHF).%20Ma%20pointure%3A%20">Commander</a>
    </div>
  </div>

</div>

<p class="info">Paiement par Twint ou virement à la remise en main propre ou à l'envoi. Livraison sous quelques jours en Suisse.</p>

<footer>
  Éditeur : Noa Testut-Gstyr, Chemin Vy des Mores 14a, 1291 Commugny, Suisse. Contact : noatestutgstyr@icloud.com.
</footer>

</body>
</html>
